From a407d07e0d7338cf4d047d20caa5f41d4c5b3f6b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FlameFlag <github@flameflag.dev>
Date: Fri, 1 May 2026 23:41:16 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] src: fix GTK widget sizing crashes on Linux

FromDIP(-1) incorrectly scales the -1 sentinel value (meaning
'auto-calculate') through DPI conversion, producing values like -2
or -3 that violate GTK's gtk_widget_set_size_request assertion
(width >= -1). Replace all FromDIP(-1) with plain -1.

Also guard gtk_cell_layout_get_cells() with a GTK_IS_CELL_LAYOUT
type check since ComboBox may not implement the CellLayout interface
on all GTK3 configurations.
